---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" activePage="about">
  <div class="about-hero">
    <h1>OpenRG</h1>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Open Reading Group</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section">
    <p class="text-body">
      We're kicking off a new round of monthly RG talks + open discussion
      covering biology, physics, ML, and related research topics. Everyone is
      welcome — come listen, share ideas, and chat!
    </p>
    <p class="text-body">
      Feel free to DM or reply in Discord if you want to present!
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section">
    <h3>Our Philosophy</h3>
    <blockquote class="quote">
      "I couldn't reduce it to the freshman level. That means we don't really understand it."
      <cite>— Richard Feynman</cite>
    </blockquote>
    <p class="text-body">
      We believe the best way to learn is to teach. Preparing a talk forces you to truly understand a topic — if you can explain it clearly to others, you've mastered it. Every presentation is a chance to sharpen both your knowledge and your communication skills.
    </p>
    <p class="text-body">
      OpenRG is built on openness — open topics, open to everyone, and open discussion. We bring together people from biology, physics, ML, and beyond, because the most interesting ideas often emerge at the intersection of disciplines. You don't need to be an expert to present; an introduction-level talk is just as valuable as cutting-edge research. We're a community of learners, not a hierarchy of experts.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section">
    <h3>Topics We Cover</h3>
    <div class="tag-list">
      <span class="tag">Biology</span>
      <span class="tag">Physics</span>
      <span class="tag">Machine Learning</span>
      <span class="tag">Neuroscience</span>
      <span class="tag">Future Tech</span>
      <span class="tag">STEM</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section">
    <h3>Schedule</h3>
    <p class="text-small">Every Saturday, 2:00 PM – 3:00 PM PST (Vancouver)</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section text-center">
    <a href="https://discord.gg/47S3xZ4F" class="discord-btn">💬 Join Our Discord</a>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section">
    <h3>Organizers</h3>
    <div class="organizer-list">
      <div class="organizer">Xuzhe Xia</div>
      <div class="organizer">Quentin Huang</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
